  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 982c26cf4db1789448d42fd03f6764ca, type: 3}
  m_Name: GrandMom
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GrandMomSoul
  name: GrandMom
  IdleReplices:
  - Son, choose me! I can stand against the Shaitan!
  - "Oh-ho! Why are you feeding into the Shaitan\u2019s game?! Clench your will and
    just banish him already!"
  - "This is nothing! Just panic everywhere... it\u2019s only the Shaitan! Deal with
    him!"
  - I have faced worse spirits than this. This one will bow before me.
  HoverReplices:
  - "This Shaitan is the kind that runs with its tail between its legs! Let me loose
    and I\u2019ll show you real power!"
  - "Don\u2019t hesitate. A ritual like this needs confidence, not fear."
  DragReplices:
  - Oh? Where will the ritual take place? Fine then. I cannot lose to the Shaitan
    anyway.
  - "You\u2019re really choosing me? Smart choice."
  PutInReplices:
  - "Tch! Hey! You never said I\u2019d be cooked alive! Well\u2026 I\u2019m not exactly
    alive but still!"
  InBoilReplices:
  - "NO\u2014 WAIT!!! THIS IS A MISUNDERSTANDING!!!"
  - "I DIDN\u2019T SIGN UP FOR THIS!!! LET ME OUT!!!"
  - THIS IS NOT A RITUAL, THIS IS MURDER!!!
  - "YOU CAN\u2019T DO THIS TO ME!!! I\u2019M THE GREAT BAKSY!!!"
  - "IT BURNS\u2014 IT BURNS SO MUCH!!! WHY IS THIS HAPPENING?!"
  - SOMEONE STOP HIM!!! PLEASE!!!
  bonusDescription: 
  SoulTalking: 0
  tiltRecude: 0.01
